---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy & Disclaimers | Everyday AI Lab"
  description="Everyday AI Lab Privacy Policy and Legal Disclaimers: zero-tracking principles, encrypted newsletter storage, and health/commercial risk notices."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/privacy"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 space-y-8">
    <header class="border-b-2 border-[#181715] pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#181715] text-[#FAF7F2] text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
        <span>🛡️</span>
        <span>LEGAL & PRIVACY POLICY</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#181715] tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy & Disclaimers
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#78716C] mt-2">
        Effective Date: October 24, 2026 · Version 1.2
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none space-y-6 text-sm text-[#383530] leading-relaxed font-sans">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-[#181715] border-b border-[#E6E0D6] pb-2">
          1. Zero Commercial Tracking
        </h2>
        <p>
          Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz) operates on principles of radical transparency and user privacy. We run zero third-party advertising tracking pixels, zero cross-site behavioral cookies, and we never sell browsing data to data brokers.
        </p>
        <p>
          Aggregated readership metrics are collected using lightweight edge-side beacons solely measuring pageview volumes per URL without storing personal identification or device fingerprinting.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-[#181715] border-b border-[#E6E0D6] pb-2">
          2. Newsletter Storage & Data Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you enter your email address to subscribe:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Storage</strong>: Your email is transmitted via HTTPS and stored in an encrypted Cloudflare KV key-value cluster;</li>
          <li><strong>Purpose</strong>: Used solely for dispatching new essays, practical prompt templates, and significant lab updates;</li>
          <li><strong>Unsubscribe & Deletion</strong>: You can request immediate and permanent deletion of your email record at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:editor@0500005.xyz" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold underline">editor@0500005.xyz</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-[#181715] border-b border-[#E6E0D6] pb-2">
          3. Clear Legal & Commercial Disclaimers
        </h2>
        <div class="bg-[#FAF7F2] p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#181715] space-y-3">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#181715] flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>⚠️</span>
              <span>Commercial Pricing & Supply Chain Disclaimer</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#57524A] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Workflow prompts (such as Issue #09 itemized materials quotations) are designed for structural categorization, unit standardization, and mathematical calculation. Large language models cannot determine real supplier contract pricing or spot commodity costs. All unit prices must be verified against genuine vendor contracts before commercial submission.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-[#E6E0D6]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#181715] flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>🩺</span>
              <span>Health, Mental Wellness & Family Disclaimer</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#57524A] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Essays touching on personal emotional reflections (such as ChillFirst) represent subjective life experiments and do not constitute professional clinical psychology, psychotherapy, or medical diagnosis. In case of acute emotional distress or mental health crises, seek licensed medical care or call a certified crisis hotline immediately.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-[#181715] border-b border-[#E6E0D6] pb-2">
          4. Model Ratings & Silicon Academy Context
        </h2>
        <p>
          Scores and persona descriptions in Silicon Academy reflect qualitative editorial impressions derived from daily creative and engineering workflows. They are not synthetic laboratory benchmarks. AI model architectures and vendor API terms iterate rapidly; refer to official lab documentation for canonical specifications.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-[#181715] border-b border-[#E6E0D6] pb-2">
          5. Contact & Editorial Inquiries
        </h2>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#181715]/20 space-y-1">
          <div>Editorial Desk: <a href="mailto:editor@0500005.xyz" class="font-bold text-[#181715] hover:text-[#E05A2B]">editor@0500005.xyz</a></div>
          <div>Official X: <a href="https://x.com/edailab" target="_blank" class="font-bold text-[#181715] hover:text-[#E05A2B]">@edailab</a></div>
          <div>Reader Service: <a href="https://wa.me/15024301078" target="_blank" class="font-bold text-[#1E5E3A]">WhatsApp (+1 502-430-1078)</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
